{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14229090","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14229090","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1422908001:":{"text":"来钓鱼的吗？交下入场费","source_cn":"来钓鱼的吗？交下入场费","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63DCE6EC70B4CBF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422909001:0":{"text":"这片钓场被我承包啦，要钓鱼的话，先交入场费。每人一千金币。","source_cn":"这片钓场被我承包啦，要钓鱼的话，先交入场费。每人一千金币。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD0A7D0F6C5859CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422909002:1":{"text":"入场费？什么鬼东西。我玛尼娅钓了这么多年鱼，从来没听说过入场费这种玩意。","source_cn":"入场费？什么鬼东西。我玛尼娅钓了这么多年鱼，从来没听说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD02A57216987397","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422909003:0":{"text":"那是你之前钓鱼的地方都不上档次！我这里可是经过精心修缮、有鱼王出没的钓场，想钓鱼王，自然要有相应的付出！","source_cn":"那是你之前钓鱼的地方都不上档次！我这里可是经过精心修缮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE06BD71DF292AF03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422909004:0":{"text":"你说的精心修缮，是指那几个挡路的破箱子？我可是一点都没经过你的箱子，就坐着船入场了。","source_cn":"你说的精心修缮，是指那几个挡路的破箱子？我可是一点都没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2835475A9479E116","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422909005:0":{"text":"竟然还敢开价一千金币一个人……你想赚钱的话，还是抢劫更快点。","source_cn":"竟然还敢开价一千金币一个人……你想赚钱的话，还是抢劫更快点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95E3397B5C2E6CD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422909006:0":{"text":"真是强词夺理！你交不交？不交可别怪我不客气了。","source_cn":"真是强词夺理！你交不交？不交可别怪我不客气了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DE0A99587A79A39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422909007:0":{"text":"我倒要看看你怎么对我不客气，难道你想试试我这胳膊抡起你的脑袋转圈的感觉？","source_cn":"我倒要看看你怎么对我不客气，难道你想试试我这胳膊抡起你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34FC812A79E034A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422909008:0":{"text":"你、你给我等着！","source_cn":"你、你给我等着！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD70894FBC85910B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1422909009:0":{"text":"杜兰姆小跑着离开了——","source_cn":"杜兰姆小跑着离开了——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF690176777C7709","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422909010:0":{"text":"真是蛮横无理的矮人……想在钓场钓鱼，却不愿意付钱……","source_cn":"真是蛮横无理的矮人……想在钓场钓鱼，却不愿意付钱……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4EA42DE364B011A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422909011:0":{"text":"嘿，你们这两个交了钱的冤大头，可别把我当聋子。","source_cn":"嘿，你们这两个交了钱的冤大头，可别把我当聋子。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3F008F88BA0C0DB2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"嘿，你们这两个交了钱的冤大头，可别把我当聋子。","female":"嘿，你们这两个交了钱的冤大头，可别把我当聋子。","variant_male_record_index":"169564","variant_female_record_index":"169565","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422909012:0":{"text":"依我看，那个所谓的钓场老板把你从头到脚卖掉，你还要帮他数钱呢。","source_cn":"依我看，那个所谓的钓场老板把你从头到脚卖掉，你还要帮他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE1B0D6D6F0F1C1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422909013:0":{"text":"你不必替我担心，杜兰姆不会卖掉我。反倒是你，把钓场的管理人如此强硬地逼走，不知道下一步要做出什么危险举动呢！","source_cn":"你不必替我担心，杜兰姆不会卖掉我。反倒是你，把钓场的管...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AB583AC8411487B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422909014:0":{"text":"下一步当然是钓<style=\"highlight\">古岩鬣蜥</style>了。你这样的小姑娘，背着一身高级装备，把钓鱼当作时髦的玩乐，应该连古岩鬣蜥是什么都不知道吧？","source_cn":"下一步当然是钓<style=highlight>古岩鬣...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4571E4AB197C5713","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_titl